 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "n02",
   "at": 0.8,
   "text": "Who do we push? How much leverage do we have? What's a realistic saving target?",
   "caption": false
  },
  {
   "id": "n03",
   "at": 7.2,
   "text": "The answers are scattered across RFPs, bids, market reports and past purchases. Pulled together by hand, over hours."
  },
  {
   "id": "n04",
   "at": 16.2,
   "text": "Insights get missed, and savings are left on the table."
  },
  {
   "id": "n05",
   "at": 20.5,
   "text": "Meet the Sourcing Negotiation Agent.",
   "caption": false
  },
  {
   "id": "n06",
   "at": 24.6,
   "text": "The moment a sourcing event is ready for negotiation, the agent goes to work."
  },
  {
   "id": "n07",
   "at": 31.8,
   "text": "It builds a structured briefing, seven sections deep, ending in one clear recommendation."
  },
  {
   "id": "n08",
   "at": 37.8,
   "text": "First, the RFP: requirements, criteria and invited suppliers, extracted automatically."
  },
  {
   "id": "n09",
   "at": 45.8,
   "text": "Every bid, scored across technical, compliance, ESG and commercial. Dell leads, at eighty-eight point seven percent."
  },
  {
   "id": "n10",
   "at": 55.0,
   "text": "Past purchases set the baseline: seven point six percent average savings in this category."
  },
  {
   "id": "n11",
   "at": 61.8,
   "text": "Live market intelligence adds price trends, top suppliers, and geopolitical risk, each rated by severity."
  },
  {
   "id": "n12",
   "at": 69.8,
   "text": "Design to cost breaks the laptop into its components, and lands a should-cost of nine hundred and fourteen pounds. Every bid sits above it."
  },
  {
   "id": "n13",
   "at": 79.1,
   "text": "Then it simulates the award: single, dual, BAFO, multi-year. A seventy-thirty split, Dell and HP, wins on risk-adjusted value."
  },
  {
   "id": "n14",
   "at": 90.0,
   "text": "It all flows into one recommendation: preferred supplier, target price, and projected savings of one hundred and fifty-four thousand pounds."
  },
  {
   "id": "n15",
   "at": 99.6,
   "text": "Every number backed by data. Every strategy grounded in evidence."
  },
  {
   "id": "n16",
   "at": 106.3,
   "text": "Walk into every negotiation fully briefed.",
   "caption": false
  }
 ]
}